@api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5268

# 除了登入以外，所有 API 都需要 Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}。
# 先送出「登入」，後面的請求會自動引用 login 回應中的 accessToken。
# 測試帳號見 README「測試帳號」。

### 登入（成功回 accessToken）
# @name login
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

### 登入失敗（401，不區分帳號或密碼錯誤；1 分鐘內超過 5 次回 429）
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### 目前使用者
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 沒帶 token（401）
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/clinic?date=2026-11-05

### 門診清單：指定科別
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/clinic?date=2026-11-05&deptId=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 門診清單：全部科別
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/clinic?date=2026-11-05
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 病人最近 14 天生命徵象（分頁，回傳 items / totalCount / page / pageSize）
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/patients/3/vitals?days=14&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 找不到病人（404）
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/patients/999/vitals
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 新增生命徵象（201）
# @name createVital
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/patients/3/vitals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "measuredAt": "2026-11-05T09:30:00",
  "systolicBP": 128,
  "diastolicBP": 78,
  "heartRate": 70,
  "bloodSugar": null,
  "bodyWeight": null,
  "note": "api.http 測試"
}

### 修改生命徵象（200，整筆取代）
PUT {{api_HostAddress}}/api/vitals/{{createVital.response.body.vitalId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "measuredAt": "2026-11-05T09:30:00",
  "systolicBP": 135,
  "diastolicBP": 80,
  "heartRate": 72,
  "bloodSugar": null,
  "bodyWeight": null,
  "note": "已修改"
}

### 驗證失敗（400：收縮壓超出 50 到 260）
PUT {{api_HostAddress}}/api/vitals/{{createVital.response.body.vitalId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "measuredAt": "2026-11-05T09:30:00",
  "systolicBP": 999,
  "diastolicBP": 80
}

### 驗證失敗（400：收縮壓必須大於舒張壓，例如兩格填反）
PUT {{api_HostAddress}}/api/vitals/{{createVital.response.body.vitalId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "measuredAt": "2026-11-05T09:30:00",
  "systolicBP": 80,
  "diastolicBP": 120
}

### 刪除生命徵象（204；再送一次回 404）
DELETE {{api_HostAddress}}/api/vitals/{{createVital.response.body.vitalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 新增時病人不存在（404）
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/patients/999/vitals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "measuredAt": "2026-11-05T09:30:00",
  "heartRate": 70
}

### 報到（BOOKED 改成 CHECKED_IN；第二次會回 409）
PATCH {{api_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/10/checkin
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### ---------- 基本資料：科別 ----------

### 科別清單（預設只列啟用中；includeInactive=true 含停用）
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/departments?includeInactive=true&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 新增科別（201；代碼重複 409）
# @name createDept
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/departments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "deptCode": "GER",
  "deptName": "老年醫學科"
}

### 修改科別（rowVersion 必填；資料已被別人修改時 409）
PUT {{api_HostAddress}}/api/departments/{{createDept.response.body.deptId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "deptCode": "GER",
  "deptName": "老年醫學部",
  "rowVersion": "{{createDept.response.body.rowVersion}}"
}

### 停用科別（科內還有啟用中的醫師時 409）
PATCH {{api_HostAddress}}/api/departments/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "isActive": false
}

### ---------- 基本資料：醫師 ----------

### 醫師清單（可依科別篩選）
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/doctors?deptId=1&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 新增醫師（201；科別不存在或已停用 409）
# @name createDoctor
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "deptId": 2,
  "doctorName": "測試醫師",
  "title": "主治醫師"
}

### 修改醫師
PUT {{api_HostAddress}}/api/doctors/{{createDoctor.response.body.doctorId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "deptId": 2,
  "doctorName": "測試醫師",
  "title": "主任",
  "rowVersion": "{{createDoctor.response.body.rowVersion}}"
}

### 停用醫師（今天以後還有已掛號的門診時 409）
PATCH {{api_HostAddress}}/api/doctors/{{createDoctor.response.body.doctorId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "isActive": false
}

### ---------- 基本資料：病人 ----------

### 病人清單（keyword：病歷號開頭或姓名包含；電話遮罩）
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/patients?keyword=A0000&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 病人詳細資料（電話不遮罩；不存在 404）
GET {{api_HostAddress}}/api/patients/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 新增病人（201；病歷號由資料庫自動產生）
# @name createPatient
POST {{api_HostAddress}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "patientName": "測試病人",
  "gender": "F",
  "birthDate": "1950-03-15",
  "phone": "0911-222-333",
  "address": null,
  "emergencyContact": null,
  "emergencyPhone": null
}

### 修改病人
PUT {{api_HostAddress}}/api/patients/{{createPatient.response.body.patientId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "patientName": "測試病人",
  "gender": "F",
  "birthDate": "1950-03-15",
  "phone": "0911-222-444",
  "address": "台南市測試路 2 號",
  "emergencyContact": null,
  "emergencyPhone": null,
  "rowVersion": "{{createPatient.response.body.rowVersion}}"
}

### 停用病人（今天以後還有已掛號的門診時 409；停用後生命徵象不能新增、修改、刪除）
PATCH {{api_HostAddress}}/api/patients/{{createPatient.response.body.patientId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "isActive": false
}

###
